# The Basics

Welcome to Leanpub!

Here is where you will be writing your course. This file is a real, working example of how to write a course lesson in plain text with Markua formatting (which we'll explain briefly below).

You can edit the text in this file, just like if you were using Notepad or TextEdit on your computer. The difference is that you can also just click one button to preview or publish what you write as an online course that anyone in the world can buy!

Leanpub courses are written using [Markua](http://markua.com). You can read the relevant section of the Markua specification document [here](https://leanpub.com/markua/read#leanpub-auto-quizzes-and-exercises).

You can find some useful information on creating a course [here](https://leanpub.com/markua/read#leanpub-auto-creating-a-course-from-a-markua-document).

